"domain_reasoning\":\"The domain of parallel transformations for distinct keys does not overlap with the subject of culinary scaling.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"recipe-scaling\"},{\"document_id\":\":tree-fingerprint:\\\"seed:tree:ParallelIndependent\\\"\",\"reasoning\":\"Similar to the class, the structural fit is mediocre because the scaling and flagging are conceptually linked rather than independent transformations on the same document that should be run concurrently to save wall-time.\",\"fitness_score\":0.4,\"domain_reasoning\":\"No overlap with culinary or recipe-based subject matter.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"recipe-scaling\"},{\"document_id\":\":tree-class:#uuid \\\"87578758-6ee1-4372-b703-b72e5f725204\\\"\",\"reasoning\":\"The representative use for this class involves a progression/schedule (marathon training), which is a time-series expansion. While recipe scaling is a form of expansion, the 'flagging non-linearities' requirement is a diagnostic step better served by the ETL pattern than a simple progression builder.\",\"fitness_score\":0.3,\"domain_reasoning\":\"Marathon training and recipe scaling are both planning tasks, but the material (fitness vs food) and output (schedule vs ingredient list) differ significantly.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"recipe-scaling\"},{\"document_id\":\":tree-class:\\\"seed:tree:ResearchThenSynthesize\\\"\",\"reasoning\":\"The task is too small for this 4-stage shape. The avoid-when guard 'the document fits in a single :llm context' fires here; the recipe is a few lines and doesn't require chunking or complex cross-chunk synthesis.\",\"fitness_score\":0.1,\"domain_reasoning\":\"The guard 'the document fits in a single :llm context' applies here, indicating this complex document-processing domain is the wrong fit.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"recipe-scaling\"},{\"document_id\":\":tree-fingerprint:\\\"seed:tree:Researc